# dev-util/h5i (::pwr 0.5.0) — in amdkdehard's package list since 2026-10-16
# (every derived hard profile inherits it; keyword in ../package.accept_keywords/h5i.keywords).
#
# containers: OFF by default in the ebuild; without it the 'container'
#   confinement tier (rootless podman) is compiled out and h5i fails closed
#   at runtime. The profile ships podman+passt+slirp4netns+nftables for this.
# browser / web (0.5.0 ebuild, both OFF by default): upstream turned 0.5 into
#   a web red-team workbench; 'browser' links the rendering engine and its
#   MITM proxy, 'web' bakes an npm-built UI (vite + the node graph at build
#   time) into a confinement tool. Neither is needed for 'h5i box' — leave
#   them off on a hardened image.
dev-util/h5i containers
